OL,3,ABus hits train stopped on French side
OL,4,Aof Channel Tunnel, with 19 injured
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bus has hit a stationary freight
OL,7,Ftrain near the French entrance to the
OL,8,FChannel Tunnel, injuring the driver and
OL,9,F18 passengers, the French authorities
OL,10,Fsay.
OL,12,FThe bus, which was carrying lorry
OL,13,Fdrivers due to take a shuttle rail
OL,14,Fservice, struck the train at the
OL,15,Floading platform of the tunnel in
OL,16,FCoquelles, near Calais.
OL,18,FTwo people were severely injured and
OL,19,Fevacuated by helicopter though no one's
OL,20,Flife appeared to be in danger, a local
OL,21,Fofficial said.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
