OL,3,ABus hits train stopped on French side
OL,4,Aof Channel Tunnel, with 19 injured
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal sub-prefect Agathe Cury said that
OL,7,Ffreight traffic and Eurostar passenger
OL,8,Ftraffic through the tunnel had not been
OL,9,Fdisrupted by the incident, which
OL,10,Foccurred at 19:27 (17:27 GMT), apart
OL,11,Ffrom a brief stoppage to allow the
OL,12,Finjured to be evacuated.
